      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two cases are presented in which amidetrizoate (Urografin) was accidentally introduced into the intrathecal cavity. Intrathecal lavage and continuous administration of thiopentone were very successful in preventing further systemic deterioration."},
